Facial Data Processing Our application uses Google ML Kit (Face Mesh Detection) to detect facial landmarks and expressions in real-time to provide the core 3D face tracking features of the app.

Data Collection and Storage: The facial recognition process happens 100% locally on your device. We do NOT collect, store, transmit, or share your facial data, images, or face meshes with our servers or any third parties. All facial mapping data is temporarily processed in your device's volatile memory (RAM) and is immediately discarded once the camera view is closed or the recording is finished.

Saved face templates are stored securely in the app's local private storage on your device, and they never leave your phone.
